1
00:00:03,161 --> 00:00:10,221
Open Artificial Intelligence, Provider Connections, click Add Connection, and click Add on OpenAI.

2
00:00:10,687 --> 00:00:13,462
Enter a Title and a Technical name.

3
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:16,779
The technical name cannot be changed later.

4
00:00:16,779 --> 00:00:22,667
For a service other than OpenAI, enter its Endpoint, the base address of its API.

5
00:00:23,132 --> 00:00:25,767
Enter the API key of the service.

6
00:00:25,767 --> 00:00:29,144
It is stored securely and never shown again.

7
00:00:29,144 --> 00:00:33,332
Click Save, and the connection is ready for deployments.

